title: Authorizations › New case › Referral › Referral checklist
route: /authorizations/new/:draftId?ref=RF-2053
intro: One referral as a checklist of 11 items in four sections. Reader found each item or did not. This diagram covers the rows and their buttons; the buttons around the card are in 'Checklist buttons'.
dir: TD
also: Demo only: Reader's findings are invented. The same sample always reads the same.
---
start s1 "Click 'Check' on an arrived referral\nor Reader finishes reading dropped files"
start s2 "Click the crumb 'Referral'\non the full referral page"
start s3 "Click 'Referral' in the stepper, or 'Back'\non Medical records, when the case holds a referral"

screen sc1 "New case › Referral\nReader chip, 'read', then the documents\n'Referral form · 2 pages', 'Face sheet · 1 page'"
process p0 "Referral is marked opened\nSidebar badge drops"
screen sc2 "Patient card\nInitials, age, RF number, source, channel, 'received 4 h ago'\nUrgency pill, '{Program} requested', status pill once decided"
process pr "'8 of 11 ready' with a bar, and '3 to go'\nAll done: 'Nothing is missing'\nOnce Verify has run the total is 12"

group gSec "Four sections, each with 'x of y'"
  screen sA "PATIENT\nPatient initials and age\nPatient contact information is present\nPatient age is within the program's range"
  screen sB "REFERRER\nClinician credentials are accepted\nClinician signature is present\nThe order has not expired"
  screen sC "CLINICAL\nA valid diagnosis code is present\nRequired clinical components are present\nRequested service matches the program\nUrgent criteria are documented"
  screen sD "COVERAGE\nInsurance and member ID are found\nVerify checked coverage (Optional until it has run)"
endgroup

decision dRow "State of a row?"
process rDone "Done\n'Found: F10.20 · Referral form, page 1'\nNo buttons"
process rMiss "Missing: nothing was found\nNo signature, components, urgent criteria, contact, diagnosis or insurance"
process rWarn "Check this: found, but wrong\nCredentials, expired order, level of care, short ICD-10 code, age under 18, lapsed coverage"
process rWait "Waiting on the referrer\n'Asked by fax, 1 d ago.'\nNo 'Ask' button, 'Mark OK' stays"

click cAsk "Click 'Ask the referrer' on a row\n(the insurance row has no 'Mark OK')"
click cOk "Click 'Mark OK' on a row"
click cCov "Click 'Run coverage check'\nor 'Check again' on the coverage row"
goto gAsk "Continues in: New case › Referral › Ask the referrer"
goto gOk "Continues in: New case › Referral › Mark OK or decline"
goto gCov "Continues in: New case › Referral › Check coverage"
goto gBtn "Continues in: New case › Referral › Checklist buttons"

s1 --> sc1
s2 --> sc1
s3 --> sc1
sc1 --> p0 --> sc2 --> pr --> sA --> sB --> sC --> sD
sc2 -.-> gBtn

sD --> dRow
dRow -->|Found| rDone
dRow -->|Nothing found| rMiss
dRow -->|Found, wrong| rWarn
dRow -->|Question sent| rWait
rMiss --> cAsk
rWarn --> cAsk
rMiss --> cOk
rWarn --> cOk
rWait --> cOk
sD -.-> cCov
cAsk --> gAsk
cOk --> gOk
cCov --> gCov
